{
  "_comment": "design/orchestrator_verify_lane.md S3 option A + S5.2/5.4. Standalone settings file for the verify-probe archetype -- NOT a repos.d fragment (permission_profiles.render_permissions is keyed by repo, this is keyed by archetype in fworker.resolve_worker_settings). Grant is read-only reach + probe execution; the only writes are reports/** in the worker's own worktree. Bare 'Write'/'Edit' are deliberately absent from allow (acceptEdits auto-approves edits not explicitly denied, same mechanism the acceptance.json deny entries below rely on) -- mailbot/sentinel are add_dirs for this archetype but are NOT in guard.sh's PRIMARY_TREES wall, so they are denied here explicitly; every other add_dir (foreman, bin, kb, agent, logs, minerva, work-queue, projects/nest, pokemon) is already walled by guard.sh regardless of this file.",
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "acceptEdits",
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Grep",
      "Glob",
      "Write(reports/**)",
      "Edit(reports/**)",
      "Bash(git *)",
      "Bash(python3 *)",
      "Bash(pytest *)",
      "Bash(python3 -m pytest*)",
      "Bash(node --test*)",
      "Bash(npm test*)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/wq *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/lumen-pr *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/slock *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/lumen-run *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/fleet-search *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/fleet-exec *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/lumen_state.py *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/lumen_busy *)",
      "Bash(/home/lumen/bin/mask-secrets)",
      "Bash(cat *)",
      "Bash(ls *)",
